%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6626c84bb700413428bce8fec5aff79d, type: 3}
  m_Name: IncapableOfAnything
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _description: 'player starts talking about how much jessi CAN''T do; a lot of which
    are things "normal human beings" CAN


    according to the player, jessi can''t:

    -
    understand even the simplest of concepts, constantly needing to ask for clarification
    or leading the conversation in a totally wrong direction

    - ^ related: think
    critically

    - handle normal human interaction without blowing a fuse

    -
    be mindful of the space she''s given; instead she forces herself into spaces
    she doesn''t belong in'
  _sameOptionTarget: 1
  _lines:
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Haven't you noticed just how much you're incapable of? I thought
      it would be clear to you by now.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Your ability is far below that of the average person. It's honestly
      a little sad.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Oh yeah? Like what?!
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I'm getting to that now.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: For someone who wants to pretend to be a normal human being so
      badly, you really can't do many things.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: You can't understand the simplest of concepts even when boiled
      down to its most basic form.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: You always need copious amounts of clarification or lead the conversation
      in a completely unfavorable direction.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: On that note, it's as if you were born without the ability to
      think critically.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: You never take your mistakes as lessons and continue to exhibit
      stupidity whenever the opportunity arises.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: You can't even handle normal human interaction without blowing
      a fuse; your circuitry immediately goes haywire at the thought of participating
      in common dialogue.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Yet you attempt to involve yourself in every opening for a conversation
      and manage to waste everyone's space and time.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: You lack the ability to be mindful of the space that you're granted
      and squeeze your way into those that you don't belong. Thinking about it alone
      is a bother.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Man, I guess I should just drop dead, shouldn't I??
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: If I can't do anything, at least I can fertilize the dirt with
      my lifeless, otherwise useless body!!!
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Hmm, no, I think that would be a poor fate for the crops.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Are you seriously feeling bad for some stupid plants because of
      me? Am I really that disgusting to you?!
  _playerReplyOptions: []
  _npcReplies: []
  _gameEnd: 1
